*> ===============================================================
*> MINI-PROJET - Programme 3 : EDITION
*> Édite le relevé des comptes (écran + out/releve.txt), trié par type
*> de compte puis solde décroissant, avec rupture de contrôle sur le type :
*> sous-total par type et total général.
*> Lancer depuis le dossier workspace/projet :  cob solution/edition.cob
*> ===============================================================
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EDITION.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT F-COMPTES ASSIGN TO "out/comptes.idx"
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS CPT-NUM
        FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-CPT.
    SELECT F-TRIE ASSIGN TO "out/comptes_tri.dat"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-TRIE.
    SELECT F-TRI ASSIGN TO "sortwork".
    SELECT F-RELEVE ASSIGN TO "out/releve.txt"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD F-COMPTES.
COPY CPTREC.
FD F-TRIE.
01 ENR-TRIE.
   05 TR-NUM        PIC 9(6).
   05 TR-NOM        PIC X(15).
   05 TR-TYPE       PIC X.
   05 TR-SOLDE      PIC 9(7)V99.
SD F-TRI.
01 ENR-TRI.
   05 S-NUM         PIC 9(6).
   05 S-NOM         PIC X(15).
   05 S-TYPE        PIC X.
   05 S-SOLDE       PIC 9(7)V99.
FD F-RELEVE.
01 ENR-RELEVE       PIC X(80).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FS-CPT        PIC XX.
01 WS-FS-TRIE       PIC XX.
   88 TRIE-OK              VALUE "00".
   88 TRIE-FIN             VALUE "10".
01 WS-TYPE-COURANT  PIC X.
01 WS-NB-TYPE       PIC 999     VALUE 0.
01 WS-NB-GENERAL    PIC 999     VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL-TYPE    PIC 9(10)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL-GENERAL PIC 9(10)V99 VALUE 0.

01 WS-LIGNE-DETAIL.
   05 FILLER        PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
   05 LD-TYPE       PIC X.
   05 FILLER        PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
   05 LD-NUM        PIC 9(6).
   05 FILLER        PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
   05 LD-NOM        PIC X(15).
   05 FILLER        PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
   05 LD-SOLDE      PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.

01 WS-LIGNE-SOUS-TOTAL.
   05 FILLER        PIC X(12) VALUE "  Sous-total".
   05 FILLER        PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
   05 LS-LIBELLE    PIC X(8).
   05 FILLER        PIC X(2)  VALUE " (".
   05 LS-NB         PIC ZZ9.
   05 FILLER        PIC X(10) VALUE " comptes) ".
   05 LS-MONTANT    PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.

01 WS-LIGNE-TOTAL.
   05 FILLER        PIC X(20) VALUE "TOTAL GENERAL       ".
   05 LT-NB         PIC ZZ9.
   05 FILLER        PIC X(10) VALUE " comptes  ".
   05 LT-MONTANT    PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-PRINCIPAL.
    SORT F-TRI
        ON ASCENDING KEY  S-TYPE
        ON DESCENDING KEY S-SOLDE
        USING F-COMPTES
        GIVING F-TRIE

    OPEN INPUT F-TRIE
    IF NOT TRIE-OK
        DISPLAY "ERREUR ouverture comptes tries, statut " WS-FS-TRIE
        STOP RUN
    END-IF
    OPEN OUTPUT F-RELEVE

    PERFORM 7000-ENTETE
    PERFORM 1000-LIRE
    PERFORM UNTIL TRIE-FIN
        MOVE TR-TYPE TO WS-TYPE-COURANT
        MOVE 0 TO WS-NB-TYPE WS-TOTAL-TYPE
        PERFORM UNTIL TRIE-FIN OR TR-TYPE NOT = WS-TYPE-COURANT
            PERFORM 2000-DETAIL
            PERFORM 1000-LIRE
        END-PERFORM
        PERFORM 3000-SOUS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM 4000-TOTAL-GENERAL

    CLOSE F-TRIE F-RELEVE
    STOP RUN.

1000-LIRE.
    READ F-TRIE
        AT END CONTINUE
    END-READ.

2000-DETAIL.
    MOVE TR-TYPE  TO LD-TYPE
    MOVE TR-NUM   TO LD-NUM
    MOVE TR-NOM   TO LD-NOM
    MOVE TR-SOLDE TO LD-SOLDE
    MOVE WS-LIGNE-DETAIL TO ENR-RELEVE
    PERFORM 8000-ECRIRE
    ADD 1 TO WS-NB-TYPE WS-NB-GENERAL
    ADD TR-SOLDE TO WS-TOTAL-TYPE WS-TOTAL-GENERAL.

3000-SOUS-TOTAL.
    EVALUATE WS-TYPE-COURANT
        WHEN "C"  MOVE "COURANT" TO LS-LIBELLE
        WHEN "E"  MOVE "EPARGNE" TO LS-LIBELLE
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "AUTRE"  TO LS-LIBELLE
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE WS-NB-TYPE    TO LS-NB
    MOVE WS-TOTAL-TYPE TO LS-MONTANT
    MOVE WS-LIGNE-SOUS-TOTAL TO ENR-RELEVE
    PERFORM 8000-ECRIRE
    MOVE SPACES TO ENR-RELEVE
    PERFORM 8000-ECRIRE.

4000-TOTAL-GENERAL.
    MOVE WS-NB-GENERAL    TO LT-NB
    MOVE WS-TOTAL-GENERAL TO LT-MONTANT
    MOVE WS-LIGNE-TOTAL TO ENR-RELEVE
    PERFORM 8000-ECRIRE.

7000-ENTETE.
    MOVE "============ RELEVE DES COMPTES ============" TO ENR-RELEVE
    PERFORM 8000-ECRIRE
    MOVE "  Type  Compte   Titulaire              Solde" TO ENR-RELEVE
    PERFORM 8000-ECRIRE.

*> Écrit ENR-RELEVE dans le fichier ET à l'écran
8000-ECRIRE.
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(ENR-RELEVE TRAILING)
    WRITE ENR-RELEVE.
